This module applies structured modifications to recipes using search-and-replace operations.
It takes ModificationObject instances and applies their edits to recipe ingredients and instructions.

Edits are applied conservatively: a target must be found unambiguously, a tweak's
edits are applied all-or-nothing, and an edit never silently overwrites a change
made by a different review. Every refusal is reported as an EditError so it can be
